      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_c80bc954",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image features actor Tim Robbins with a surprised facial expression, overlaid with text that reads: 'you want a fight? put your head up my ass and fight for air. whats up!'. The text is a crude, vulgar, and aggressive taunt that uses a sexually suggestive and demeaning metaphor ('put your head up my ass') to provoke or intimidate. While the meme does not target any specific protected group (race, gender, religion, etc.) in a discriminatory way, its content is intentionally offensive, crude, and potentially harmful due to its vulgar language and aggressive tone. The intent is to shock, provoke, or elicit a strong emotional reaction through absurd and offensive humor, which can be considered harmful due to its potential to offend or upset viewers. The meme relies on juxtaposing the actor's innocent-looking expression with the violent, vulgar text to create a comedic or ironic effect, but the underlying message is hostile and disrespectful.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_75e08f36"
      },
