      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The text 'you want a fight?' is mapped onto Tim Robbins' surprised facial expression.",
      "description": "The top text 'you want a fight?' is juxtaposed with Tim Robbins' surprised facial expression, creating an analogical mapping where the text's implied subject (a confrontational challenger) is visually represented by the actor's startled look. This mapping uses the actor's expression to embody the persona or state described in the text.",
