      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme contains vulgar, aggressive, and sexually suggestive language ('put your head up my ass and fight for air') that is intended to provoke, intimidate, and demean. While it does not target specific protected groups (race, gender, religion, etc.), its content is offensive, crude, and potentially harmful due to its shock value and hostile tone. The juxtaposition of Tim Robbins' innocent expression with the vulgar taunt creates a comedic effect but masks underlying hostility, which can offend or upset viewers.",
